READ/RETRY ASSERTIONS:
- Stale follower and role change reject with NOT_LEADER/leaderHint, without reading cached snapshot/results.
- Read barrier NO_QUORUM maps to READ_UNAVAILABLE; write NO_QUORUM remains ERROR_RESPONSE and keeps requestId.
