- Lookup UNKNOWN does not cause a new business requestId on retry; PENDING/UNKNOWN/APPLIED_REJECTED field/null combinations conform to SPEC-03.
- Reusing requestId with a changed payload yields REQUEST_ID_CONFLICT and cannot overwrite the first fixture result.

